Error [E2307]: Returned string views need a stable owner relationship
  --> tests/ui/string_view_return_unknown_owner_set.jet:1:48
    |
  1 | fn pass(view: View<str>) -> View<str> { return view }
    |                                                ^^^^
 Why: Each public `View<str>` slot must name a bounded set of receiver, parameter, or static `String` sources that stay live; this return did not prove those sources
 Fix: Return a view derived from parameters or the receiver on every path, or return an owned `String` copy with `.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2307

Error [E0120]: `view` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/string_view_return_unknown_owner_set.jet:1:48
    |
  1 | fn pass(view: View<str>) -> View<str> { return view }
    |                                                ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return view.copy()` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `view: ^View<str>`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from view` and return a view derived from `view`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
